{"id":"mafuyu_expression_25_test","title":"真冬の表情テスト：消えた売上予測データ","version":"v039_320","return":{"mode":"storyMenu","storyMenuTab":"other","storyId":"mafuyu_expression_25_test","eventId":"mafuyu_expression_25_test"},"format":"v039_steps","renderPolicy":{"background":"forceReplace","sprites":"storyOnly","forceCenterSprites":true},"summary":"販売勝負後に欠けた売上予測データを店長と検証しながら、真冬の正式25表情を順番に確認する表示確認用シナリオ。","testPurpose":"霧島 真冬の採用済み正式25表情について、最新manifestの画像パスで表示、切替、透過、位置、トリミングを一巡確認する。","steps":[{"bg":"images/assets/bg/battle_store_lv1.png","speaker":"","text":"【表情テスト】真冬と消えた売上予測データ","bgMode":"forceReplace","clearStorySprites":true,"forceBackgroundReplace":true},{"speaker":"","text":"販売勝負のあと。ひだまりストアに残った店長と、ビリビリ電機の真冬は少しだけ居残っていた。"},{"speaker":"霧島 真冬","text":"［01/25 澄まし］貴殿、少々時間をいただけますか。先ほどの販売データに不整合があります。","expressionId":"01","expressionLabel":"澄まし","storySprites":[{"id":"bb","src":"images/assets/char/bb_mafuyu/standing/bb_mafuyu_expression_01_composed.webp","side":"center","left":"50%","zIndex":2500,"opacity":1,"maxHeight":"min(76dvh, 780px)"}]},{"speaker":"霧島 真冬","text":"［02/25 やさしい微笑み］協力いただけるのですね。ありがとうございます。二人で見れば確認も早いでしょう。","expressionId":"02","expressionLabel":"やさしい微笑み","storySprites":[{"id":"bb","src":"images/assets/char/bb_mafuyu/standing/bb_mafuyu_expression_02_gentle_smile.webp","side":"center","left":"50%","zIndex":2500,"opacity":1,"maxHeight":"min(76dvh, 780px)"}]},{"speaker":"霧島 真冬","text":"［03/25 笑顔］原因が分かれば再発防止までできます。では、始めましょう。","expressionId":"03","expressionLabel":"笑顔","storySprites":[{"id":"bb","src":"images/assets/char/bb_mafuyu/standing/bb_mafuyu_expression_03_smile.webp","side":"center","left":"50%","zIndex":2500,"opacity":1,"maxHeight":"min(76dvh, 780px)"}]},{"speaker":"霧島 真冬","text":"［04/25 怒り］……この数値は看過できません。入力元を確認します。","expressionId":"04","expressionLabel":"怒り","storySprites":[{"id":"bb","src":"images/assets/char/bb_mafuyu/standing/bb_mafuyu_expression_04_anger.webp","side":"center","left":"50%","zIndex":2500,"opacity":1,"maxHeight":"min(76dvh, 780px)"}]},{"speaker":"霧島 真冬","text":"［05/25 軽い嫌悪］根拠のない手修正が入っていますね。こういう処理は好みません。","expressionId":"05","expressionLabel":"軽い嫌悪","storySprites":[{"id":"bb","src":"images/assets/char/bb_mafuyu/standing/bb_mafuyu_expression_05_mild_disgust.webp","side":"center","left":"50%","zIndex":2500,"opacity":1,"maxHeight":"min(76dvh, 780px)"}]},{"speaker":"霧島 真冬","text":"［06/25 悲しみ］集計そのものが失われていたら……積み上げた検証が無駄になります。","expressionId":"06","expressionLabel":"悲しみ","storySprites":[{"id":"bb","src":"images/assets/char/bb_mafuyu/standing/bb_mafuyu_expression_06_sadness.webp","side":"center","left":"50%","zIndex":2500,"opacity":1,"maxHeight":"min(76dvh, 780px)"}]},{"speaker":"霧島 真冬","text":"［07/25 心配／不安］バックアップまで壊れていないでしょうか。少し気になります。","expressionId":"07","expressionLabel":"心配／不安","storySprites":[{"id":"bb","src":"images/assets/char/bb_mafuyu/standing/bb_mafuyu_expression_07_worry.webp","side":"center","left":"50%","zIndex":2500,"opacity":1,"maxHeight":"min(76dvh, 780px)"}]},{"speaker":"霧島 真冬","text":"［08/25 動揺］待ってください。差分が一気に増えました。これは想定外です。","expressionId":"08","expressionLabel":"動揺","storySprites":[{"id":"bb","src":"images/assets/char/bb_mafuyu/standing/bb_mafuyu_expression_08_agitated.webp","side":"center","left":"50%","zIndex":2500,"opacity":1,"maxHeight":"min(76dvh, 780px)"}]},{"speaker":"霧島 真冬","text":"［09/25 驚き］……なるほど。参照列が一つずれていたのですね。","expressionId":"09","expressionLabel":"驚き","storySprites":[{"id":"bb","src":"images/assets/char/bb_mafuyu/standing/bb_mafuyu_expression_09_surprise.webp","side":"center","left":"50%","zIndex":2500,"opacity":1,"maxHeight":"min(76dvh, 780px)"}]},{"speaker":"霧島 真冬","text":"［10/25 照れ］貴殿、画面を見るためとはいえ近いです。……いえ、作業は続けます。","expressionId":"10","expressionLabel":"照れ","storySprites":[{"id":"bb","src":"images/assets/char/bb_mafuyu/standing/bb_mafuyu_expression_10_shy.webp","side":"center","left":"50%","zIndex":2500,"opacity":1,"maxHeight":"min(76dvh, 780px)"}]},{"speaker":"霧島 真冬","text":"［11/25 期待］修正後の再計算、期待値は正常範囲へ戻るはずです。","expressionId":"11","expressionLabel":"期待","storySprites":[{"id":"bb","src":"images/assets/char/bb_mafuyu/standing/bb_mafuyu_expression_11_expectation.webp","side":"center","left":"50%","zIndex":2500,"opacity":1,"maxHeight":"min(76dvh, 780px)"}]},{"speaker":"霧島 真冬","text":"［12/25 得意げ］予測どおりです。数字は、きちんと見れば答えてくれます。","expressionId":"12","expressionLabel":"得意げ","storySprites":[{"id":"bb","src":"images/assets/char/bb_mafuyu/standing/bb_mafuyu_expression_12_proud.webp","side":"center","left":"50%","zIndex":2500,"opacity":1,"maxHeight":"min(76dvh, 780px)"}]},{"speaker":"霧島 真冬","text":"［13/25 いたずらな笑顔・舌出しウィンク］では次の検算は貴殿に。外したら一手、私の勝ちということで。","expressionId":"13","expressionLabel":"いたずらな笑顔・舌出しウィンク","storySprites":[{"id":"bb","src":"images/assets/char/bb_mafuyu/standing/bb_mafuyu_expression_13_playful_tongue_wink.webp","side":"center","left":"50%","zIndex":2500,"opacity":1,"maxHeight":"min(76dvh, 780px)"}]},{"speaker":"霧島 真冬","text":"［14/25 いたずらな笑顔・歯見せウィンク］ふふ。冗談です。……半分ほどは。","expressionId":"14","expressionLabel":"いたずらな笑顔・歯見せウィンク","storySprites":[{"id":"bb","src":"images/assets/char/bb_mafuyu/standing/bb_mafuyu_expression_14_playful_toothy_wink.webp","side":"center","left":"50%","zIndex":2500,"opacity":1,"maxHeight":"min(76dvh, 780px)"}]},{"speaker":"霧島 真冬","text":"［15/25 困り笑い］一箇所だけ誤差が残りましたね。綺麗には終わってくれませんか。","expressionId":"15","expressionLabel":"困り笑い","storySprites":[{"id":"bb","src":"images/assets/char/bb_mafuyu/standing/bb_mafuyu_expression_15_troubled_smile.webp","side":"center","left":"50%","zIndex":2500,"opacity":1,"maxHeight":"min(76dvh, 780px)"}]},{"speaker":"霧島 真冬","text":"［16/25 真剣／決意］原因を特定します。曖昧なまま本番へ戻すつもりはありません。","expressionId":"16","expressionLabel":"真剣／決意","storySprites":[{"id":"bb","src":"images/assets/char/bb_mafuyu/standing/bb_mafuyu_expression_16_determined.webp","side":"center","left":"50%","zIndex":2500,"opacity":1,"maxHeight":"min(76dvh, 780px)"}]},{"speaker":"霧島 真冬","text":"［17/25 伏し目／余韻］……小春さんや日向さんが感覚で前へ進めるのは、少し羨ましい時があります。","expressionId":"17","expressionLabel":"伏し目／余韻","storySprites":[{"id":"bb","src":"images/assets/char/bb_mafuyu/standing/bb_mafuyu_expression_17_downcast_afterglow.webp","side":"center","left":"50%","zIndex":2500,"opacity":1,"maxHeight":"min(76dvh, 780px)"}]},{"speaker":"霧島 真冬","text":"［18/25 拗ね／ぷいっ］別に落ち込んではいません。私は私のやり方で十分です。","expressionId":"18","expressionLabel":"拗ね／ぷいっ","storySprites":[{"id":"bb","src":"images/assets/char/bb_mafuyu/standing/bb_mafuyu_expression_18_sulking.webp","side":"center","left":"50%","zIndex":2500,"opacity":1,"maxHeight":"min(76dvh, 780px)"}]},{"speaker":"霧島 真冬","text":"［19/25 泣き笑い］直りました。……よかった。これで二人にも正しい数字を渡せます。","expressionId":"19","expressionLabel":"泣き笑い","storySprites":[{"id":"bb","src":"images/assets/char/bb_mafuyu/standing/bb_mafuyu_expression_19_tearful_smile.webp","side":"center","left":"50%","zIndex":2500,"opacity":1,"maxHeight":"min(76dvh, 780px)"}]},{"speaker":"霧島 真冬","text":"［20/25 無言の圧／見透かす］貴殿。途中から原因に気づいていましたね？　黙って観察していたでしょう。","expressionId":"20","expressionLabel":"無言の圧／見透かす","storySprites":[{"id":"bb","src":"images/assets/char/bb_mafuyu/standing/bb_mafuyu_expression_20_silent_pressure.webp","side":"center","left":"50%","zIndex":2500,"opacity":1,"maxHeight":"min(76dvh, 780px)"}]},{"speaker":"霧島 真冬","text":"［21/25 黒い笑顔］なるほど。私がどこで気づくか試していた、と。……良い度胸です。","expressionId":"21","expressionLabel":"黒い笑顔","storySprites":[{"id":"bb","src":"images/assets/char/bb_mafuyu/standing/bb_mafuyu_expression_21_dark_smile.webp","side":"center","left":"50%","zIndex":2500,"opacity":1,"maxHeight":"min(76dvh, 780px)"}]},{"speaker":"霧島 真冬","text":"［22/25 安堵］ですが助かりました。ありがとうございます、貴殿。","expressionId":"22","expressionLabel":"安堵","storySprites":[{"id":"bb","src":"images/assets/char/bb_mafuyu/standing/bb_mafuyu_expression_22_relieved.webp","side":"center","left":"50%","zIndex":2500,"opacity":1,"maxHeight":"min(76dvh, 780px)"}]},{"speaker":"霧島 真冬","text":"［23/25 見惚れ／ときめき］……こうして一緒に考える時間は、嫌いではありません。","expressionId":"23","expressionLabel":"見惚れ／ときめき","storySprites":[{"id":"bb","src":"images/assets/char/bb_mafuyu/standing/bb_mafuyu_expression_23_captivated.webp","side":"center","left":"50%","zIndex":2500,"opacity":1,"maxHeight":"min(76dvh, 780px)"}]},{"speaker":"霧島 真冬","text":"［24/25 眠そう］もうこの時間ですか。集中すると時間感覚が薄れますね……少し眠いです。","expressionId":"24","expressionLabel":"眠そう","storySprites":[{"id":"bb","src":"images/assets/char/bb_mafuyu/standing/bb_mafuyu_expression_24_sleepy.webp","side":"center","left":"50%","zIndex":2500,"opacity":1,"maxHeight":"min(76dvh, 780px)"}]},{"speaker":"霧島 真冬","text":"［25/25 照れ隠し怒り］その顔は何ですか。別に、貴殿ともう少し検証したかったわけでは……ありませんから。","expressionId":"25","expressionLabel":"照れ隠し怒り","storySprites":[{"id":"bb","src":"images/assets/char/bb_mafuyu/standing/bb_mafuyu_expression_25_bashful_anger.webp","side":"center","left":"50%","zIndex":2500,"opacity":1,"maxHeight":"min(76dvh, 780px)"}]},{"speaker":"","text":"（真冬の25表情をすべて確認しました）"}]}
